# L'Homme Luxe — Pluie Violette — Wet Mineral Cloth — DHP 2025 V1

## Authority and status

Inventory-independent target plus stock-corrected executable design hypothesis for 30 mL EdP at 20% concentrate: 6,000 uL concentrate and 24,000 uL alcohol phase. Authority and Git state were frozen/rechecked for this wave. **NOT TESTED / HOLD. No procurement, no compounding, no wear, no safety/stability conclusion, and no release or integration action is authorized.**

## Target identity

Defined before dosing: a pleasure-first wet violet textile, not a blue aquatic. A humid reflective surface is incised by wet ginger; violet cloth with a suede-floral lining hangs inside molecular mineral air; the air releases onto a literal cedar/vetiver landing; one pear-skin Romandolide aura keeps the cloth continuous.

Hard exclusions: Calone melon, Floralozone laundry, Dihydromyrcenol sport-blue, detergent radiance, metallic glare, empty transparency, powder-only violet, and wetness made by indiscriminate aquatic stacking.

## Functional architecture before dosing

|#|Module|Primary owner|Pleasure / relation job|
|---:|---|---|---|
|1|Humid reflective surface|Cyclamen Aldehyde|A curved damp surface, not marine water|
|2|Wet ginger cortex|Ginger EO|Living incision through reflection|
|3|Green mineral seam|Parmavert + Scentenal + geosmin trace|Rain-green perimeter without detergent|
|4|Violet textile suspension|Givaudan AIMI + ionone gradient|Main cloth in three violet densities|
|5|Suede-floral lining|Suederal + Damascol|Softens the underside and prevents hollow transparency|
|6|Molecular air release|Hedione + Helional|Separates surface, cloth, and mineral depth|
|7|Cedar receiving wall|Virginia cedar + broad cedar|Dry back plane catching the wet cloth|
|8|Vetiver landing axis|Indian vetiver + Vetikon + Vetival|Downward root motion and dry landing|
|9|Yielding sandal interior|Javanol + Sandalore + Ebanol|Mineral/fresh/creamy resistance below textile|
|10|Sole Romandolide cloth recurrence|Romandolide + slow salicylate/benzoate|One exact musk carries pear-skin textile, never a generic musk stack|

Ten modules, ten links, nineteen texture roles, and 58 ideal states conserve source floors. They are not proof of smelled depth.

